{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55437","headline":"题天申宫三首 一 · 宋维","name":"题天申宫三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"殿阙（《宜兴县志》作「阁」）盘空压巨鳌，洗然灵迹助风骚。\n玉龙卧久洞云冷，玄鹤唳频山月高。\n深谷羽童探石菌，晓堂真侣饮樱（《宜兴县志》作「仙」）桃。\n可怜不悟长生者，尘里区区改鬓毛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55437.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55437","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}